---
description: Testing conventions
globs: **/*.test.ts,**/*.test.tsx,packages/core/test/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Vitest. One behavior per test. Name tests as sentences: "drops lockfile sections".
- Use real fixture diffs under packages/core/test/fixtures; never hand-write fake diffs inline.
- Tests for packages/core must not touch the network or the filesystem outside fixtures.
- Co-locate unit tests as `*.test.ts` next to the source; fixture-driven tests may live in `packages/core/test/`.
- Run one package with `pnpm --filter @dekko/core test`; run everything with `pnpm test`.
- Fix the code, not the test, unless the spec changed. Never weaken an assertion to get green.
